    "summary": "Clean install of the repository under Node 22 through daemon-ctl.sh built fs-ext and every native module (fs-ext previously failed with the same toolchain); the installed daemon's update installed once then skipped. Finding: a hand-run --ignore-scripts install (the s9 workaround) left fs-ext unbuilt, which a successful npm install does not repair; repaired with npm rebuild, and a genuinely failed install is rolled back by npm and retried correctly. Full sweep per directory: 7356 tests, 25 failures, all pre-existing and classified.",
